WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.436
- Do ever get anything wrong?

00:00:01.436 --> 00:00:02.585
What do you do 
when you make a mistake?

00:00:02.585 --> 00:00:03.776
- I get everything wrong

00:00:03.776 --> 00:00:05.475
it's just that I can't recall it

00:00:05.475 --> 00:00:08.987
because once it's wrong 
I'm moving on to the next thing.

00:00:08.987 --> 00:00:11.266
Dwelling on what 
you fucked up on

00:00:11.266 --> 00:00:14.416
is the quickest way for 
the next thing not to work.

00:00:14.416 --> 00:00:15.786
Right?
- [Shira] Yeah.

00:00:15.786 --> 00:00:17.386
(audience applause)

00:00:17.386 --> 00:00:18.326
- I think I do everything,

00:00:18.326 --> 00:00:19.576
I mean you know this.

00:00:19.576 --> 00:00:20.706
This is a fun thing to say.

00:00:20.706 --> 00:00:22.146
Some people in 
the back know this.

00:00:22.146 --> 00:00:25.096
I was a breakout YouTube 
star in the first year.

00:00:25.096 --> 00:00:28.608
2006. I decided that 
the right strategy was

00:00:28.608 --> 00:00:30.506
to leave YouTube completely

00:00:30.506 --> 00:00:33.646
and go to Viddler because 
Viddler offered me equity

00:00:33.646 --> 00:00:36.186
in their company and 
I've left an enormous amount

00:00:36.186 --> 00:00:39.527
of attention, I deviated 
from my attention thesis

00:00:39.527 --> 00:00:42.536
to do short term economics 
and equity in a company

00:00:42.536 --> 00:00:44.087
and I lost.

00:00:44.087 --> 00:00:46.426
I lost. When DRock finally 
came in my life two years ago

00:00:46.426 --> 00:00:48.338
and we started to try to build 
up my YouTube the first time,

00:00:48.338 --> 00:00:50.657
I was sitting on 40,000 followers

00:00:50.657 --> 00:00:52.258
in a world where 
I could have had millions

00:00:52.258 --> 00:00:53.476
if I just stayed the course.

00:00:53.476 --> 00:00:55.206
So, I make 
mistakes all the time,

00:00:55.206 --> 00:00:57.328
I'm re-org'ing 
VaynerMedia every day

00:00:57.328 --> 00:00:59.797
'cause it's based on a mistake 
I made the prior year.

00:00:59.797 --> 00:01:01.897
I just don't give a 
fuck about my mistakes,

00:01:01.897 --> 00:01:03.878
everybody else cares 
about your mistakes.

00:01:03.878 --> 00:01:05.088
If you're worried about 
your own mistakes,

00:01:05.088 --> 00:01:06.377
you've already lost.

00:01:06.377 --> 00:01:09.678
("Exhipopyo" by Kwesibeats)

